'''Dragon Smokesculpture''' is a sculpting [[Spells|spell]] that creates a dragon out of smoke.{{Ref|m|35}}

==Description==
The spell is very complex, utilizing several different signs and sigils in order to form a fake dragon out of smoke, which is capable of flying through the air and roaring.{{Ref|m|35}}

==Usage==
The spell was used by [[Beldaruit]] during his conversation with [[Coco]] in his room. During their conversation, he drew the spell on a flat, circular, floating platform in the air, which he used to draw the seal on.{{Ref|m|35}}

